      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A level is a map where the player will go through multiple waves of enemies.
    Once the player beats all levels, they win the game.\r\n\nThe collection of cards
    that the player keeps permanently throughout all levels. Cards can be permanently
    added or removed from the deck throughout the game.\r\n\nThe cards that are available
    for the player to play\n\n\n\n\n\r\n\n\n\n\nThe pile that the player draws cards
    from into their hand. At the start of a level, all cards from your deck are placed
    in it.\r\n\nTake a card from the draw pile into your hand\r\n\nThe pile that
    cards go to once played from the player\u2019s hand. Once the draw pile runs
    out of cards, the discard pile is shuffled into the draw pile.\r\n\nMove a card
    into the discard pile after you\u2019ve played it"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
